e:T7c6,<div class="callout accent"><p>アプリの再開の経路は一本です。data.json と <code>~/.mycmux/pane-sessions/</code> に残した会話の ID を、CLI の <code>--resume</code> に渡します。全ペインを一斉には起こさず、画面に出たペインから順に起こします。</p><p>起動の経路は 2 本あります。claude、codex、grok は CLI を直接起動します。claude-codex と手動の再開（<span class="keys"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class="key-join">+</span><kbd>P</kbd></span>、続きから、<span class="keys"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class="key-join">+</span><kbd>Shift</kbd><span class="key-join">+</span><kbd>T</kbd></span>、<code>spawn --resume-session</code>）は、ランチャーを通ります。</p><p>model と effort はどこにも保存されないので、再開すると CLI の既定に戻ります。作者の個人の hook である resume-inject は、会話の再開とは別物です。SessionStart のたびに「全体で最新の別のセッション」の要約を足す仕組みで、ペインを区別しません。</p></div>
<p>再開の仕組みは、安全弁を足しながら何度も作り直されてきました。始まりは 5 月の版の事故で、<span class="keys"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class="key-join">+</span><kbd>P</kbd></span> の環境変数が他のペインへ漏れ、勝手に resume されました。その後も、7 月の遅延 resume と、8 月下旬の「再起動で別の会話が戻る」事故の修正が続いています。</p><p>「resume」という語は、コードと運用の中で 13 通りの意味に使われています（<a href="#words">ページ末の表</a>）。まず、アプリと外側がそれぞれ何を覚えているかを 1 枚の表にまとめ、そのあとで再開の経路を順に追います。外側とは、エージェント製品と、作者の運用（~/.claude にある skill、hook、スクリプト、台帳）のことです。</p>1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site-main page-dev-resume","id":"main","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"page-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"mycmux 開発者向け"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"resume と継続"}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"dev-nav","aria-label":"開発者向けページの中の移動","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"dev-nav-root","href":"/dev","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"開発者向け"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","/dev/boundary",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/boundary","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"境界"}]}],["$","li","/dev/editor",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/editor","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"エディタ本体"}]}],["$","li","/dev/observation",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/observation","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"観測とカード"}]}],["$","li","/dev/dispatch",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/dispatch","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"ディスパッチ"}]}],["$","li","/dev/resume",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/resume","aria-current":"page","children":"resume"}]}],["$","li","/dev/house",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/house","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"エージェントの家"}]}],["$","li","/dev/subsystems",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/subsystems","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"周辺の仕組み"}]}],["$","li","/dev/runtime",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/runtime","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"いま動いているもの"}]}],["$","li","/dev/plans",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/plans","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"設計文書と実装"}]}],["$","li","/dev/responsibility",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/responsibility","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"立ち位置と約束"}]}],["$","li","/dev/glossary",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/dev/glossary","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"用語"}]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"intro","children":[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$e"}}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-layout","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"sections":[{"id":"memory","title":"何を覚えているか"},{"id":"restore","title":"起動時の復元"},{"id":"commands","title":"種類ごとの再開コマンド"},{"id":"model-effort","title":"model と effort が戻らない理由"},{"id":"dormancy","title":"休眠"},{"id":"manual","title":"手動の再開"},{"id":"pane-sessions","title":"ペインと会話の対応表 pane-sessions"},{"id":"harness","title":"個人の hook とスクリプト"},{"id":"incidents","title":"既知の事故と対策"},{"id":"words","title":"「resume」が指す 13 のもの"},{"id":"mismatches","title":"境界の食い違い"},{"id":"unverified","title":"未確認事項"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-article","children":[["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"このページの目次"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"このページの目次","children":["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","memory",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#memory","children":"何を覚えているか"}]}],["$","li","restore",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#restore","children":"起動時の復元"}]}],["$","li","commands",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#commands","children":"種類ごとの再開コマンド"}]}],["$","li","model-effort",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#model-effort","children":"model と effort が戻らない理由"}]}],["$","li","dormancy",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#dormancy","children":"休眠"}]}],["$","li","manual",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#manual","children":"手動の再開"}]}],["$","li","pane-sessions",{"children":"$L10"}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15"]}]}]]}],"$L16","$L17","$L18"]}]]}]]}]
